      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IMOGENE PASS (3) missed the frame last time when eighth (17.47) at Taree Super Track in a Grade 5 but not beaten far the start prior. This looks easier and expected to bounce back. RIO STELLA (6) was in winning form two back (22.72) at Geelong but ran below best last time at Bulli, finishing 6th. A big run wouldn't surprise. KISS AND RUN (8) boasts a strong record this journey here with two wins and three minors from six tries. Placed last time (16.03) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing second and beaten 2.75 lengths. Looks suited here and can measure up. ANGELIC BAROQUE (4) is always hard to beat when she races at this trip.",
